Subject: [PATCH] fix(asks): prepared answers are retired (D747, 1695 off)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The founder, 9 Oct: „no prepared answers; nothing is prepared or shown
under a person's yes button." One switch, PREPARED_ANSWER_ON = false:
nothing is composed when an ask is written, and preparedAnswerOn answers
null, so a line stored before the switch is neither prefilled nor sent on
„yes". The column and the code stay.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
